    "readme_description": "In a string composed of `'L'`, `'R'`, and `'X'` characters, like `\"RXXLRXRXL\"`, a move consists of either replacing one occurrence of `\"XL\"` with `\"LX\"`, or replacing one occurrence of `\"RX\"` with `\"XR\"`. Given the starting string `start` and the ending string `result`, return `True` if and only if there exists a sequence of moves to transform `start` to `result`.",
