                "content": "```\nInput: start = \"RXXLRXRXL\", result = \"XRLXXRRLX\"\nOutput: true\nExplanation: We can transform start to result following these steps:\nRXXLRXRXL ->\nXRXLRXRXL ->\nXRLXRXRXL ->\nXRLXXRRXL ->\nXRLXXRRLX\n```"
